    <!-- Description -->
    <string name="description">This APK focuses on simulating "light UI thread, heavy RenderThread" scroll scenarios for Friends Circle. Through 10 load levels, you can observe different OEM scheduling strategies in hardware rendering stack:\n\nThis app provides 10 different load levels:\n• Minimal Load: No additional load\n• In-Frame Loads (3): Execute load during frame rendering with blur/shader effects\n• Between-Frame Loads (3): Execute load between frames\n• Mixed Loads (3): Combined in-frame and between-frame loads with multi-layer composition</string>
    
